== users/alex/data/review.md
# Cashcast review (private)

For your eyes only. It shows short payee samples so you can tell the
deposit groups and recurring payments apart. It stays in private/ and the app never sends it anywhere.

## Deposit groups


## Recurring payments

- Payments #1: RENT CANARY03
- Payments #2: GROCER CANARY02
- Payments #3: RESTAURANT CANARY05
- Payments #4: PHONE CO CANARY04
